· No "Boost" pill — fold into UsagePopover
· Top row = passive readouts (usage bars + agent count
   inline as badges, no buttons)
· Bottom row = essential actions only
· "···" = everything else (workspace toggles beyond zen,
   panel, terminals, insights, help, feedback, update)
· Settings = last
· Pros:  feels like a real status bar — minimal chrome
· Cons:  agent●3 not clickable in passive row;
         needs extra panel-toggle entry in "···"
